## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `cmd/<% .Name %>/` | `main` package: wiring only (flags, build info, exit codes) |
| `internal/app/` | Application logic; unit-testable, not importable by other modules |
| `docs/` | Documentation and ADRs |
| `Makefile` | Common developer tasks (`make help`) |
| `.github/workflows/` | CI: vet, test, lint |

## Decisions

Record significant decisions as short ADRs in `docs/adr/` (one file per decision).
